                            </tr>
                          </thead>
                          <tbody id="sbTableBody">
                            <tr><td colspan="9" class="profile-empty">加载中…</td></tr>
                          </tbody>
                        </table>
                      </div>
                      <p id="sbBoardMessage" class="board-hint board-footer-hint">看板数据存放于 商品队列/选品看板/board.json；只有「推送上品」才会把素材复制进当前产品目录。</p>
                    </article>
        
                    <div id="sbDetailModal" class="board-modal hidden" aria-hidden="true">
                      <div class="board-modal-backdrop" data-sb-close="1"></div>
                      <div class="board-modal-panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="sbDetailTitle">
                        <div id="sbDetailBody"></div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </section>
        
                  <section class="workflow-view" data-view-panel="selection-radar">
