                  <section class="workflow-view" data-view-panel="materials">
                    <div class="section-heading">
                      <div><span class="section-index">01</span><h2>产品素材</h2></div>
                      <p>上传当前商品的全部事实图片，系统会自动去重并保持商品视觉一致性。</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="scene-tabs" aria-label="上品场景页内入口">
                      <button type="button" class="scene-tab active" data-home-view="materials">商品事实</button>
                      <button type="button" class="scene-tab" data-home-view="planning">市场调研</button>
                      <button type="button" class="scene-tab" data-home-view="content">Listing</button>
                      <button type="button" class="scene-tab" data-home-view="images">作图</button>
                      <button type="button" class="scene-tab" data-home-view="listing-matrix">上架草稿</button>
                      <button type="button" class="scene-tab" data-home-view="data-quality-review">上架质检</button>
