                  <section class="workflow-view" data-view-panel="listing-matrix">
                    <div class="section-heading">
                      <div><span class="section-index">ONBOARDING</span><h2>上架接入 / SKU 映射</h2></div>
                      <p>将 Product 绑定到真实店铺 Listing、平台商品 ID、Listing URL 和 SKU Mapping，服务上架、履约、库存与后续运营。</p>
                    </div>
                    <!-- 上架资料（2026-10-28）：不生成 Listing —— 那由前面 tab 完成。
                         本面板只做：① 从 1688 采集原始资料；② 用已有 Listing 生成店小秘上架信息
                         (erp/field_plan.json) 并自动填充店小秘（不保存）；③ 可选地把这次填充存成草稿。 -->
                    <article class="panel dossier-panel" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
                      <style>
                        .dossier-panel .dossier-steps{display:flex;flex-direction:column}
                        .dossier-panel .dossier-step{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:16px 0;border-top:1px solid #eef2f7}
                        .dossier-panel .dossier-step:first-child{border-top:0;padding-top:2px}
                        .dossier-panel .dossier-no{flex:0 0 22px;height:22px;margin-top:1px;border-radius:50%;background:#eef3ff;color:#2563eb;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
                        .dossier-panel .dossier-body{flex:1 1 240px;min-width:0}
                        .dossier-panel .dossier-title{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;margin-bottom:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
                        .dossier-panel .dossier-title small{font-weight:400;color:#64748b}
                        .dossier-panel .dossier-act{flex:0 0 auto;margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
                        .dossier-panel .dossier-out{padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #eef2f7}
                        .dossier-panel .form-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
                        .dossier-panel .form-grid label{min-width:0}
                        .dossier-panel select{width:100%}
                      </style>
        
                      <div class="profile-card-heading">
                        <div>
                          <span class="mini-label">LISTING DOSSIER</span>
                          <h3>上架资料 · 生成店小秘上架信息</h3>
                          <p class="profile-suggestion">Listing 由前面 tab 产出；这里只把它变成店小秘上架信息，并自动填充（不保存）。</p>
                        </div>
                        <span id="dossierBadge" class="profile-status">IDLE</span>
                      </div>
        
                      <div class="dossier-steps">
                        <div class="dossier-step">
                          <div class="dossier-no">1</div>
                          <div class="dossier-body">
                            <div class="dossier-title">采集原始资料 <small>1688 链接 → SKU 表 + 图片 + 来源URL</small></div>
                            <div class="form-grid">
                              <label>来源 URL（*.1688.com）<input id="dossierUrl" placeholder="https://detail.1688.com/offer/xxxx.html" /></label>
                              <label>产品名（可选）<input id="dossierTitle" placeholder="用于包名与日志" /></label>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                          <div class="dossier-act">
                            <button id="dossierCollectButton" class="button primary" type="button">开始采集</button>
                          </div>
                        </div>
        
                        <div class="dossier-step">
                          <div class="dossier-no">2</div>
                          <div class="dossier-body">
                            <div class="dossier-title">生成上架信息并填充店小秘
                              <small>用已有 Listing 产出 field_plan.json，然后自动填入店小秘，<b>不保存</b></small>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-grid">
                              <label>产品包（需已完成 Listing）<select id="dossierPackageSelect"></select></label>
                              <label>店铺<select id="dossierStoreSelect"></select></label>
                              <label>引用模板<select id="dossierTemplateSelect"></select></label>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                          <div class="dossier-act">
                            <button id="dossierPrepareButton" class="button primary" type="button">生成并填充</button>
                          </div>
                        </div>
        
                        <div class="dossier-step">
                          <div class="dossier-no">3</div>
                          <div class="dossier-body">
                            <div class="dossier-title">写草稿 <small>可选：把上面这次填充真正保存为店小秘草稿（不发布）</small></div>
                            <p class="profile-suggestion" style="margin:0;">会新建一条待发布草稿；默认不执行。</p>
                          </div>
                          <div class="dossier-act">
                            <button id="draftCommitButton" class="button warning" type="button">写草稿</button>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
        
                      <div class="dossier-out">
                        <div id="dossierResult" style="display:none;"></div>
                      </div>
                    </article>
        
                    <div class="commerce-layout">
                      <article class="panel">
                        <div class="legacy-onboard-box">
                          <div class="profile-card-heading"><div><span class="mini-label">LIVE LEGACY</span><h3>创建老品档案并接入</h3></div></div>
                          <div class="form-grid two">
                            <label>商品名称<input id="legacyProductDisplayName" maxlength="120" /></label>
                            <label>店铺<select id="legacyStoreSelect"></select></label>
                          </div>
                          <div class="form-grid two">
                            <label>平台商品 ID<input id="legacyPlatformProductId" /></label>
                            <label>Listing URL<input id="legacyListingUrl" /></label>
                          </div>
                          <label class="profile-field">平台标题<input id="legacyListingTitle" /></label>
                          <div class="form-grid two">
                            <label>库存 SKU<input id="legacyInventorySku" /></label>
                            <label>链接生命周期
                              <select id="legacyListingLifecycle">
                                <option value="listed">已上架</option>
                                <option value="observing">观察中</option>
                                <option value="first_order">首单</option>
                                <option value="growing">增长中</option>
                                <option value="stable">稳定</option>
                                <option value="declining">下滑</option>
                              </select>
                            </label>
                          </div>
                          <div class="form-grid two">
                            <label>platform_sku_id<input id="legacyPlatformSkuId" /></label>
                            <label>Seller SKU 编码<input id="legacySellerSkuCode" /></label>
                          </div>
                          <div class="form-grid three">
                            <label>条码<input id="legacyPlatformBarcode" /></label>
                            <label>变体<input id="legacyVariantName" /></label>
                            <label>仓库 SKU<input id="legacyWarehouseSku" /></label>
                          </div>
                          <label class="profile-field">备注<textarea id="legacyNotes" maxlength="10000"></textarea></label>
                          <button id="legacyOnboardButton" class="button primary wide">创建老品档案并接入</button>
                          <p id="legacyOnboardHint" class="profile-suggestion">平台字段会写入 listing / SKU 映射 JSON，不写入 product-profile。</p>
                          <hr class="soft-divider" />
                        </div>
                        <div class="profile-card-heading"><div><span class="mini-label">STEP 1</span><h3>选择商品与店铺</h3></div></div>
                        <div class="form-grid two">
                          <label>商品<select id="listingProductSelect"></select></label>
                          <label>店铺<select id="listingStoreSelect"></select></label>
                        </div>
                        <div class="profile-card-heading compact-heading"><div><span class="mini-label">STEP 2</span><h3>填写平台商品实体</h3></div></div>
                        <div class="form-grid two">
                          <label>平台商品 ID<input id="listingPlatformProductId" placeholder="AliExpress 商品 ID" /></label>
                          <label>平台链接状态<input id="listingStatus" placeholder="Online / Draft / Offline" /></label>
                        </div>
                        <label class="profile-field">平台标题<input id="listingTitle" placeholder="AliExpress 后台商品标题" /></label>
                        <div class="form-grid two">
                          <label>库存 SKU<input id="listingInventorySku" /></label>
                          <label>链接生命周期
                            <select id="listingLifecycle">
                              <option value="not_listed">未上架</option>
                              <option value="listed">已上架</option>
                              <option value="observing">观察中</option>
                              <option value="first_order">首单</option>
                              <option value="growing">增长中</option>
                              <option value="stable">稳定</option>
                              <option value="declining">下滑</option>
                              <option value="dead">死亡</option>
                              <option value="offline">下架</option>
                            </select>
                          </label>
                        </div>
                        <div class="form-grid two">
                          <label>包型 / 场景<input id="listingBagModel" /></label>
                          <label>目标尺寸<input id="listingTargetSize" /></label>
                        </div>
                        <label class="profile-field">商品链接 URL<input id="listingUrl" /></label>
                        <div class="form-grid two">
                          <label>图片版本<input id="listingImageVersion" /></label>
