                      <p>官网尺寸核验、NotebookLM 库存匹配、双重人工确认、逐 SKU 素材锁定与 1:1 主图生成。</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="insert-hero-actions">
                      <div class="insert-task-id"><small>TASK ID</small><strong id="insertTaskId">待创建</strong></div>
                      <button id="returnMarketRadarButton" class="button secondary hidden">返回市场雷达候选</button>
                      <button id="insertPauseTaskButton" class="button warning hidden">暂停当前任务</button>
                      <button id="insertAbandonTaskButton" class="button danger hidden">遗弃并开始新任务</button>
                    </div>
                  </div>
        
                  <article class="insert-step-card">
                    <header><span>01</span><div><h3>目标外包识别</h3><p>上传同一包型家族的目标包图片，识别品牌、版本和公开尺寸。</p></div></header>
                    <label class="upload-zone compact">
                      <input id="insertBagInput" type="file" accept=".jpg,.jpeg,.png,.webp" multiple />
                      <span class="upload-icon">＋</span><strong>上传目标外包图片</strong>
                      <span>外包事实确认后将自动锁定</span>
                    </label>
                    <div class="url-import compact-url-import">
                      <div>
                        <strong>通过图片 URL 导入</strong>
                        <p id="insertBagUrlHint">每行一个公开图片直链，最多 12 条。</p>
                      </div>
                      <textarea id="insertBagUrls" placeholder="https://example.com/bag.jpg" spellcheck="false"></textarea>
                      <button id="importInsertBagUrlsButton" class="button secondary">导入 URL</button>
                    </div>
                    <div id="insertBagGallery" class="image-list"></div>
                    <button id="insertIdentifyButton" class="button primary wide">识别包型并联网核对尺寸</button>
                    <details id="insertIdentificationBox" class="result-box hidden">
                      <summary>查看识别与公开尺寸报告</summary><pre id="insertIdentificationText"></pre>
                    </details>
                  </article>
        
                  <article class="insert-step-card">
                    <header><span>02</span><div><h3>人工确认包型与尺寸</h3><p>确认品牌、包型家族和全部尺寸 SKU，指定市场主推版本。</p></div></header>
                    <div class="form-grid two">
                      <label>品牌<input id="insertBrand" placeholder="LOEWE" /></label>
                      <label>包型家族<input id="insertBagFamily" placeholder="Puzzle" /></label>
                    </div>
                    <div id="bagVariantRows" class="variant-table"></div>
                    <div class="row-actions">
                      <button id="addBagVariantButton" class="button secondary">添加尺寸 SKU</button>
                      <button id="unlockBagButton" class="button warning hidden">返回修改包型尺寸</button>
                      <button id="confirmBagButton" class="button primary">确认并锁定外包事实</button>
                    </div>
                  </article>
        
                  <article class="insert-step-card">
                    <header><span>03</span><div><h3>NotebookLM 库存匹配与开发规划</h3><p>发送唯一任务边界到"内胆尺寸库"，判断复用库存或规划新尺寸。</p></div></header>
