                      <button id="importNotebookButton" class="button small">导入并回填</button>
                      <p id="notebookImportError" class="text-danger hidden"></p>
                    </details>
                    <details id="notebookResultBox" class="result-box hidden">
                      <summary>查看 NotebookLM 规划结果</summary><pre id="notebookResultText"></pre>
                    </details>
                  </article>
        
                  <article class="insert-step-card">
                    <header><span>04</span><div><h3>冻结内胆方案与 SKU 素材</h3><p>填写最终内胆尺寸、库存 SKU、材质、颜色、结构和真实重量。</p></div></header>
